#. column 2: Obtain an array of Padjali milpreves.
msgctxt "Achievement:3002:0:1"
msgid "Aetherpool Party: Milpreves"
msgstr "Усиленное оружие: милпреве"

#. ja: パジャルミルプレーヴェを入手する
#. de: Ein Quartett Padjal-Hascherlite erhalten.
#. fr: Obtenir des mein gwrac'h padjals.
